//     interrupts are read-only zero). LCOFIP is then read in sip when delegated and in mip (T-SBI)
//     otherwise, LCOFIE is set in mie (T-SBI), and an LCOFI is expected in S/HS-mode when delegated
//     and in M-mode otherwise. Counting uses RVMODEL_HPM_COUNTER with event RVMODEL_MHPMEVENT_VAL,
